codex
The schema can express all seven minimum invariants in SQLite. I’m adding two missing structural pieces: a batch-insert producer-fence trigger and an irreversible submission-state transition trigger. The existing partial indexes, composite foreign keys, and batch-completion triggers will each get a direct raw-SQL rejection test.
